265	1287,1002,1640,2012 - 1287,1130,1350,1475	265. Shoot;	A slender Barberry shoot beset with branching thorns, each an altered leaf, with small buds in their angles and toothed leaves at the base.
266	917,1077,1332,1834 - 917,1077,946,1250 - 1296,1700,1332,1834	266. cluster of leaves and raceme;	A cluster of bristly-toothed Barberry leaves on a short twig, with a drooping raceme of buds and open flowers hanging from among them.
